{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Arc Tracker",
    "steam_appid": 2476680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/0c6684f35b545bd94cf8588382c150ca.avif?t=1753966508\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arc Tracker:\u00a0A whole new paradigm for puzzle games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the ball, avoid obstacles, earn coins, and reach the destination using only circular orbits! It sounds easy and simple... but it's not! Immerse yourself in a world of deep and challenging puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/cec3dab3b2d6b01ba8aea57cf9318dae.poster.avif?t=1753966508\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/cec3dab3b2d6b01ba8aea57cf9318dae.webm?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/cec3dab3b2d6b01ba8aea57cf9318dae.mp4?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BASIC Mode:\u00a0Chill, immersive, and basic play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BASIC mode, you can fully experience the essence of \u201cArc Tracker\u201d. Learn basic controls, explore how to clear stages within a limited number of moves, think carefully, and develop a better understanding of key puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/d1677badb42c69fca5d10b91066f098e.poster.avif?t=1753966508\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/d1677badb42c69fca5d10b91066f098e.webm?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/d1677badb42c69fca5d10b91066f098e.mp4?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AUTO Mode:\u00a0A perfect blend of brainpower and reflexes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike BASIC mode, the ball never stops! Play faster and learn more advanced control skills as you change the orbit before the ball hits obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/ed1a0e731120ab209c1e8b1467d8ee99.poster.avif?t=1753966508\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/ed1a0e731120ab209c1e8b1467d8ee99.webm?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/ed1a0e731120ab209c1e8b1467d8ee99.mp4?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC Mode:\u00a0Breaking all the rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can drag the orbit itself in real-time and move the ball freely! The ability to stabilize a bouncing ball, almost like riding a unicycle, will push you to greater technical heights.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/0c6684f35b545bd94cf8588382c150ca.avif?t=1753966508\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arc Tracker:\u00a0A whole new paradigm for puzzle games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the ball, avoid obstacles, earn coins, and reach the destination using only circular orbits! It sounds easy and simple... but it's not! Immerse yourself in a world of deep and challenging puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/cec3dab3b2d6b01ba8aea57cf9318dae.poster.avif?t=1753966508\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/cec3dab3b2d6b01ba8aea57cf9318dae.webm?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/cec3dab3b2d6b01ba8aea57cf9318dae.mp4?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BASIC Mode:\u00a0Chill, immersive, and basic play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BASIC mode, you can fully experience the essence of \u201cArc Tracker\u201d. Learn basic controls, explore how to clear stages within a limited number of moves, think carefully, and develop a better understanding of key puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/d1677badb42c69fca5d10b91066f098e.poster.avif?t=1753966508\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/d1677badb42c69fca5d10b91066f098e.webm?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/d1677badb42c69fca5d10b91066f098e.mp4?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AUTO Mode:\u00a0A perfect blend of brainpower and reflexes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike BASIC mode, the ball never stops! Play faster and learn more advanced control skills as you change the orbit before the ball hits obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/ed1a0e731120ab209c1e8b1467d8ee99.poster.avif?t=1753966508\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/ed1a0e731120ab209c1e8b1467d8ee99.webm?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476680/extras/ed1a0e731120ab209c1e8b1467d8ee99.mp4?t=1753966508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC Mode:\u00a0Breaking all the rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can drag the orbit itself in real-time and move the ball freely! The ability to stabilize a bouncing ball, almost like riding a unicycle, will push you to greater technical heights.</p>",
